      <title>Το πρόγραμμα του 22ου Final Four του Κυπέλλου Γυναικών</title>
      <link>https://www.e-handball.gr/2026/02/26/%cf%84%ce%bf-%cf%80%cf%81%cf%8c%ce%b3%cf%81%ce%b1%ce%bc%ce%bc%ce%b1-%cf%84%ce%bf%cf%85-22%ce%bf%cf%85-final-four-%cf%84%ce%bf%cf%85-%ce%ba%cf%85%cf%80%ce%ad%ce%bb%ce%bb%ce%bf%cf%85-%ce%b3%cf%85%ce%bd/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf-%25cf%2580%25cf%2581%25cf%258c%25ce%25b3%25cf%2581%25ce%25b1%25ce%25bc%25ce%25bc%25ce%25b1-%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-22%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-final-four-%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-%25ce%25ba%25cf%2585%25cf%2580%25ce%25ad%25ce%25bb%25ce%25bb%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-%25ce%25b3%25cf%2585%25ce%25bd</link>
      <description>Με ανακοίνωσή της η ΟΧΕ γνωστοποίησε το πρόγραμμα του 22ου Final Four του Κυπέλλου Γυναικών, που θα διεξαχθεί το διήμερο15-16 Μαρτίου στο ΚΓ Κωστακιών Άρτας. Κυριακή 15 Μαρτίου 15:15 (EΡΤFLIX) ΑΕΣΧ Πυλαίας- Αναγέννηση Άρτας 18:15 (ΕΡΤ2ΣΠΟΡ) ΠΑΟΚ- ΑΕΚ Δευτέρα 16 Μαρτίου 17:00 (ΕΡΤ2ΣΠΟΡ) Τελικός</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.e-handball.gr/2026/02/26/%cf%84%ce%bf-%cf%80%cf%81%cf%8c%ce%b3%cf%81%ce%b1%ce%bc%ce%bc%ce%b1-%cf%84%ce%bf%cf%85-22%ce%bf%cf%85-final-four-%cf%84%ce%bf%cf%85-%ce%ba%cf%85%cf%80%ce%ad%ce%bb%ce%bb%ce%bf%cf%85-%ce%b3%cf%85%ce%bd/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf-%25cf%2580%25cf%2581%25cf%258c%25ce%25b3%25cf%2581%25ce%25b1%25ce%25bc%25ce%25bc%25ce%25b1-%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-22%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-final-four-%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-%25ce%25ba%25cf%2585%25cf%2580%25ce%25ad%25ce%25bb%25ce%25bb%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-%25ce%25b3%25cf%2585%25ce%25bd</guid>
